        "density": 0.11459,
        "chars": 236,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.51
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        189,
        906,
        1565,
        1093
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, there is a need for uniform operation of the City's diverse media and entertainment functions, including operation of the City's own media assets; encouragement and development of local economic activity by the film, television, theatre, music, digital content production and distribution, advertising, and publishing sectors; and encouragement and development of new media technologies; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1994,
          "min": -1.2366
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 69,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0699
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 29670,
        "area_px": 241604,
        "density": 0.1228,
        "chars": 400,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.48
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        189,
        1138,
        1565,
        1291
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Mayor's Office of Media and Entertainment was established in 2010 to ensure that the City's media and entertainment services are well-coordinated to maximize opportunities in the most efficient and cost-effect manner, by coordinating a range of media-and entertainment-related responsibilities under one office; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.16,
          "min": -1.1412
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 60,
          "mean": -0.0018,
          "min": -0.101
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 24494,
        "area_px": 197676,
        "density": 0.12391,
        "chars": 328,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.39
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        189,
        1330,
        1565,
        1444
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Local Law No. 178 of 2017 created the Office of Nightlife, to be located within the Office of the Mayor or within any agency that does not conduct enforcement against nightlife establishment; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1431,
          "min": -1.1792
        },
        "category": {
