        1485,
        1565,
        1564
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Local Law 46 of 2021 transferred the duty to issue press credentials from the New York City Police Department to the Mayor's Office of Media and Entertainment;",
      "logprob_stats": {
